<title>USA: Sterling to buy electronics distributor.</title>
<headline>Sterling to buy electronics distributor.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterling Electronics Corp said on Monday it entered a tentative deal to acquire Marsh Electronics Inc, an electronics distributor based in Milwaukee with annual revenues of $50 million.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
